{"n":113,"name":"Al-Falaq","meaning":"The Daybreak","ayahs":5,"startPage":604,"verses":[{"i":1,"ar":"قُلۡ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلۡفَلَقِ","tr":"Qul aAAoothu birabbi alfalaqi","en":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak"},{"i":2,"ar":"مِن شَرِّ مَا خَلَقَ","tr":"Min sharri ma khalaqa","en":"From the evil of that which He created"},{"i":3,"ar":"وَمِن شَرِّ غَاسِقٍ إِذَا وَقَبَ","tr":"Wamin sharri ghasiqin itha waqaba","en":"And from the evil of darkness when it settles"},{"i":4,"ar":"وَمِن شَرِّ ٱلنَّفَّـٰثَٰتِ فِي ٱلۡعُقَدِ","tr":"Wamin sharri alnnaffathati fee alAAuqadi","en":"And from the evil of the blowers in knots"},{"i":5,"ar":"وَمِن شَرِّ حَاسِدٍ إِذَا حَسَدَ","tr":"Wamin sharri hasidin itha hasada","en":"And from the evil of an envier when he envies"}]}